+/* Wakes a cui_app_frame that is waiting for input, so the next frame begins
+ * now. Safe to call from any thread, as long as the app exists; a wake sent
+ * while no wait is in progress makes the next wait return at once. Use it
+ * when state the UI shows changes outside the UI thread (a worker, a REPL).
+ * Unlike cui_app_ui and friends, NULL is not the running app: pass the app. */
+CUI_API void cui_app_wake(cui_app *app);
